<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Tyrant of Mystacor: Rise of A Queen</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;With the dawn of a new era for Mystacor, the kingdom will find itself submerged in serious changes. Just like when the Tyrant first took over, nothing would be the same anymoreâ€¦&lt;br&gt;
But for good, this timeâ€¦&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As Shadow Weaver's key asset grows older, and her position as her right hand is solidified, the new era calls for a new ruler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A Queen shall rise, and with her, will the progress be boosted or hindered?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p align="center"&gt;&lt;img src="https://i.postimg.cc/sDtf6GMg/ROAQcover.png"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cover by Afteriwake &amp;lt;3&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Xenakis (IceRosesCrown)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mature</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Castaspella/Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Castaspella (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Micah (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angella (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Original Characters</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Lonnie (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Rogelio (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Kyle (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>The Horde Kids only show near the end</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>minor apparition of Mermista too</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - Canon Divergence</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Series Rewrite</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>we're nearing the beginning of the og series</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>badass Castaspella</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver didn't join the Horde</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>And so the romance starts!</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>may add more tags later</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>No Archive Warnings Apply</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
